@host = http://localhost:5000
@pingHost = http://localhost:5200
@contentType = application/json

### 1. GET /api/assignments -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 2. POST submission hợp lệ -> 201 + Location: /api/submissions/{id}
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/bai3-signalr"
}

### 3. POST thiếu studentCode và repositoryUrl -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### 4. POST vào assignment không tồn tại -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/bai3-signalr"
}

### 5. GET submission 1 -> 200, sau khoảng 5 giây status = graded
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/1

### 6. GET submission không tồn tại -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/999999

### 7. GET assignment 1 -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments/1

### 8. GET assignment không tồn tại -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/assignments/999

### 9. Negotiate SubmissionHub -> 200, trả connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Negotiate PingHub -> 200, trả connectionId
POST {{pingHost}}/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
